---
title: Pilau Rice
servings: 4
course: Side
locale: en
difficulty: Medium
cuisine: Indian
---

= Prepare Onion and Spices =

Heat the @ghee, butter, or oil{25%g} and fry the @onion{1}(diced) until softened and slightly browned.

Stir in @cinnamon stick (not ground){1}(cut in half lengthways), @cardamom{4%pods}, @cloves{6}, and @bay leaves{2}.\
For yellow rice: Also add  @?cumin seeds or powder{1.5%tsp} and @?ground turmeric{4%tsp}.\
Cook for ~{2%minutes}.

= Cook Rice =

Mix the onion and spice mixture with the @rice{300%g}, and cook normally.

= Multicoloured Rice =

For multicoloured rice: Wear gloves. Mix tiny amounts of @colouring powder (e.g. red, green, and yellow; not blue){0.25%tsp each} into small patches of rice, and leave to stand for ~{3%minutes}. Stir the rice to mix the coloured grains throughout.